<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Rügen Guide: 11 places – chalk cliffs, Rasender Roland, Prora &amp; Hiddensee – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Chalk cliffs and Königsstuhl</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the day or late in the afternoon – by day in summer the paths are crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>13.66224,54.57305,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Hochuferweg Sassnitz – Königsstuhl</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Start in Sassnitz and take the bus back in the evening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>13.67793,54.54523,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Binz &amp; resort architecture</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the Rasender Roland there and stroll along the promenade. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>13.61716,54.40309,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Granitz Hunting Lodge</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the train to Jagdschloss and plan time for the tower. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>13.62727,54.38059,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Putbus – the white town</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine the visit with the departure of the Rasender Roland. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>13.47354,54.35478,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Prora</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Plan the documentation centre and a beach walk together. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>13.57963,54.43269,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Cape Arkona &amp; the fishing village of Vitt</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in clear weather and walk to Vitt. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>13.43782,54.67678,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Hiddensee – car-free island</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Start early and rent a bike at the harbour. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>13.09492,54.5316,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Sellin – the pier</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at sunset and take your time. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/ruegen/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>13.69945,54.38349,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
